  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/1"/>May He renew it,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/2"/>the Holy One, blessed is He,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/3"/>for us and for all His people,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/4"/>the House of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/5"/>for goodness and blessing
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/6"/>for happiness and for rejoicing,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/7"/>for deliverance and for consolation,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/8"/>for plentiful sustenance,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/9"/>and support,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/10"/>for good life and for peace,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/11"/>for good tidings,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/12"/>and for good news,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/13"/>for rain at the proper time,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/14"/>for total recovery,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/15"/>and for early redemption,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hachodesh/yechaddeshehu/16"/>and let us say, Amein.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
